{"seq":2,"slug":"lc0033-search-rotated-array","title":"LeetCode 33 搜索旋转排序数组","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/medium-search-greedy/lc0033-search-rotated-array","wordCount":875,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"leetcode-33-搜索旋转排序数组\">LeetCode 33 搜索旋转排序数组</h1><h2 id=\"题目描述\">题目描述</h2><p>整数数组 <code>nums</code> 按升序排列，数组中的值互不相同。在传递给函数之前，<code>nums</code> 在预先未知的某个下标 <code>k</code>（0 ≤ k &lt; nums.length）上进行了旋转，使数组变为 <code>[nums[k], nums[k+1], ..., nums[n-1], nums[0], nums[1], ..., nums[k-1]]</code>。例如，<code>[0,1,2,4,5,6,7]</code> 在下标 3 处旋转后变为 <code>[4,5,6,7,0,1,2]</code>。</p>\n<p>给你旋转后的数组 <code>nums</code> 和一个整数 <code>target</code>，如果 <code>nums</code> 中存在这个目标值，则返回它的下标，否则返回 <code>-1</code>。</p>\n<p>你必须设计一个时间复杂度为 O(log n) 的算法解决此问题。</p>\n<p><strong>约束条件：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>1 ≤ nums.length ≤ 5000</li>\n<li>-10⁴ ≤ nums[i] ≤ 10⁴</li>\n<li>nums 中的每个值都是唯一的</li>\n<li>nums 是一个可能经过旋转的升序数组</li>\n<li>-10⁴ ≤ target ≤ 10⁴</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>示例 1：</strong></p>\n<p>输入：nums = [4,5,6,7,0,1,2], target = 0输出：4</p>\n<p><strong>示例 2：</strong></p>\n<p>输入：nums = [4,5,6,7,0,1,2], target = 3输出：-1</p>\n<p><strong>示例 3：</strong></p>\n<p>输入：nums = [1], target = 0输出：-1</p>\n<h2 id=\"解题思路\">解题思路</h2><p>本题的关键在于理解旋转排序数组的结构特征：无论数组在哪个位置发生旋转，以中间点划分后，<strong>至少有一半是有序的</strong>。利用这一性质可以在 O(log n) 时间内完成搜索。</p>\n<p><strong>暴力解法</strong>：遍历整个数组查找目标值，时间复杂度 O(n)，不满足题目要求。</p>\n<p><strong>二分搜索（优化解法）</strong>：每次取中间位置 <code>mid</code>，判断哪一半是有序的：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>如果 <code>nums[left] ≤ nums[mid]</code>，说明左半部分有序：<ul>\n<li>如果 <code>target</code> 在 <code>[nums[left], nums[mid])</code> 范围内，缩小到左半部分</li>\n<li>否则缩小到右半部分</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>否则右半部分有序：<ul>\n<li>如果 <code>target</code> 在 <code>(nums[mid], nums[right]]</code> 范围内，缩小到右半部分</li>\n<li>否则缩小到左半部分</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<p>这种方法的核心思想是：虽然整体无序，但每次二分都能确定一个有序区间，通过有序区间判断 target 是否在其中，从而排除一半的搜索空间。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>时间复杂度</th>\n<th>空间复杂度</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>暴力遍历</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n<td>不满足题目要求</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>二分搜索</td>\n<td>O(log n)</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n<td>最优解，利用部分有序性</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"代码实现\">代码实现</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function search(nums: number[], target: number): number {&#10;  let left = 0;&#10;  let right = nums.length - 1;&#10;&#10;  while (left &lt;= right) {&#10;    const mid = left + Math.floor((right - left) / 2);&#10;&#10;    if (nums[mid] === target) {&#10;      return mid;&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    if (nums[left] &lt;= nums[mid]) {&#10;      if (nums[left] &lt;= target &amp;&amp; target &lt; nums[mid]) {&#10;        right = mid - 1;&#10;      } else {&#10;        left = mid + 1;&#10;      }&#10;    } else {&#10;      if (nums[mid] &lt; target &amp;&amp; target &lt;= nums[right]) {&#10;        left = mid + 1;&#10;      } else {&#10;        right = mid - 1;&#10;      }&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return -1;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> search</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">nums</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[], </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">target</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> left </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> right </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nums.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  while</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (left </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> right) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> mid</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> left </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">floor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((right </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> left) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (nums[mid] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> target) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> mid;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (nums[left] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nums[mid]) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (nums[left] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> target </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> target </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nums[mid]) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        right </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> mid </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">else</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        left </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> mid </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">else</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (nums[mid] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> target </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> target </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nums[right]) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        left </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> mid </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">else</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        right </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> mid </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>代码逻辑详解：</strong></p>\n<p>首先初始化左右指针覆盖整个数组。每次循环计算中点 <code>mid</code>，直接命中则返回。否则通过比较 <code>nums[left]</code> 和 <code>nums[mid]</code> 判断哪一半有序。在有序的那一半中用范围判断决定下一步搜索方向。</p>\n<p>需要注意 <code>nums[left] &lt;= nums[mid]</code> 中的等号：当 <code>left === mid</code> 时（只剩两个元素），左半部分只有一个元素，也属于有序情况。</p>\n<p><strong>边界情况处理：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>数组只有一个元素：直接比较即可</li>\n<li>target 不存在：循环结束后返回 -1</li>\n<li>旋转点在最左或最右：退化为普通二分搜索，同样适用</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"复杂度分析\">复杂度分析</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>复杂度</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>时间复杂度</td>\n<td>O(log n)</td>\n<td>每次迭代排除一半搜索空间</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>空间复杂度</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n<td>仅使用常数个变量</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>时间复杂度方面，每次循环都将搜索区间缩小一半，因此最多执行 ⌈log₂n⌉ 次循环。空间上只使用了 <code>left</code>、<code>right</code>、<code>mid</code> 三个变量，为常数空间。</p>\n<p>本题是二分搜索的经典变体，核心技巧是<strong>在无序数组中识别局部有序区间</strong>。这一思想在 LC #153（寻找旋转排序数组中的最小值）和 LC #81（搜索旋转排序数组 II，含重复元素）中也有广泛应用。掌握&quot;至少一半有序&quot;的判断逻辑，是解决此类问题的关键。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"LeetCode 33 搜索旋转排序数组","id":"leetcode-33-搜索旋转排序数组"},{"level":2,"text":"题目描述","id":"题目描述"},{"level":2,"text":"解题思路","id":"解题思路"},{"level":2,"text":"代码实现","id":"代码实现"},{"level":2,"text":"复杂度分析","id":"复杂度分析"}],"prev":{"title":"LeetCode 435 无重叠区间","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/medium-search-greedy/lc0435-non-overlapping-intervals"},"next":{"title":"LeetCode 74 搜索二维矩阵","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/medium-search-greedy/lc0074-search-a-2d-matrix"}}